### Tools

python 13.5
uv
pyproject.toml: for dependencies and project configuration.
ollama: pure HTTP requests, no SDK. Using ManualOllamaLM for this reason  
openai: for the API. Used for the Google AI endpoint. default max_tokens: None, default max_retries: 20, max_concurrency: 5
huggingface: used for datasets and inference client for some models.
pytest
pydantic
loguru: for logging. Minimalistically, but exposing major workflows.
setfit
umap
sklearn
transformers<5.0: used for the transformers library and setfit specifically.
dotenv: for loading environment variables from a .env file whenever any token is being used.

many others, not listed here.

### Models

- Google. Used with openai API.
  - gemma-3-4b-it: smaller google model. It doesn't have system prompt and json endpoint.
  - gemini-3.1-flash-lite-preview: larger google model. Has system prompt and json endpoint.

- Hugging Face. Used with huggingface API.
  - Qwen/Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct
  - meta-llama/Meta-Llama-3-8B-Instruct
  - openai/gpt-oss-20b
  - mistralai/Mixtral-8x22B-Instruct-v0.1

